   00001| //! Seed-backed lowering of bounded coding tasks into executable Rust source.
   00002| //!
   00003| //! The coding ladder exposed a dangerous false-green: the literal-file parser
   00004| //! treated a description of source code as the bytes to write. This module is
   00005| //! the semantic route that runs before literal writes. It recognises source
   00006| //! concepts through the multilingual seed, renders Rust syntax, and completes
   00007| //! only after the client reads the written bytes back through an allowlisted
   00008| //! command.
